    "enUS": {
      "description": "These wastelands are riddled with redstone basilisk, {name}. These basilisk have adapted and flourished, more so than any of the other wildlife within the region.\n\nI have watched from afar as they hunt and go about their daily activities - the beasts exhibit a thought process more complex than even some humanoids.\n\nI must study their brains!\n\nRetrieve ten of their brains for me, {name}. The compound cannot be complete, however, without two vulture gizzards to form the base of the solution.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Basilisk Brain",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Vulture Gizzard",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Bring ten Basilisk Brains and two Vulture Gizzards to Bloodmage Lynnore.\n",
      "title": "The Basilisk's Bite",
